From: HOW2AI <ivan.meer1990@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 03:37:49 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/28] fix(a11y/ui): replace emoji-icons with lucide in chord
 visualizer
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

RealtimeChordVisualizer.tsx
- the 4xl "🎸"/"🎵" glyph above the empty state and the in-line "💡
  "/"🎸"/"🔇"/"📋" bullets in the guide card used platform-dependent
  emoji as structural icons (forbidden by docs/DESIGN_TOKENS.md)
- swap for lucide icons: Guitar / Mic (empty state), Lightbulb /
  Guitar / VolumeX / ClipboardCopy (guide bullets)
- icons inherit `text-muted-foreground` so contrast matches the
  surrounding copy; bullets become `flex items-center gap-2` so the
  glyph aligns with the baseline

Verified: `npx tsc --noEmit -p tsconfig.app.json` — 0 errors in changed
files. Icons verified to exist in src/lib/icons.ts.
---
 .../RealtimeChordVisualizer.tsx               | 28 +++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/components/chord-detection/RealtimeChordVisualizer.tsx b/src/components/chord-detection/RealtimeChordVisualizer.tsx
index 71247f46..fd373313 100644
--- a/src/components/chord-detection/RealtimeChordVisualizer.tsx
+++ b/src/components/chord-detection/RealtimeChordVisualizer.tsx
@@ -5,7 +5,7 @@
 
